# Git worktrees of this repo live here. Their node_modules symlinks back to
# the root, so committing or scanning them doubles everything.
.claude/worktrees/

# `.env` itself is committed and is Lovable's file — gpt-engineer-app[bot] added it,
# and Vite bakes VITE_SUPABASE_* into the client at build time, so untracking it
# risks the deployed build. It must therefore never receive a secret: put local
# overrides in .env.local, which Vite loads with higher precedence and which is
# ignored here.
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Serena's per-project index. Regenerated on activation; nothing here is authored.
.serena/
